{"id":"n67477-2-11","stage":1,"title":"뒤 · 之后","scene":"演出后约吃饭","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67477-2-11-1","ko":"우리 공연이 끝나면 다 같이 밥 먹을까요?","zh":"我们的演出结束后，大家一起吃饭好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"공연이","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연이","audio":"/audio/e3f5627846d80ede1303.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나면","meaning":"结束后","explanation":"끝나다：结束；-면 表示条件，在这里是“演出结束后”。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나면","audio":"/audio/dd2759215203be9a62c1.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全都","explanation":"다：所有人都；与后面的 같이 合用，다 같이 是“大家一起”。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一起","explanation":"같이：一起；다 같이 表示“大家一起”。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"1","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을까요?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을까요","audio":"/audio/1fa9921ef4932dbe5e37.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无一遗漏地；与 같이 连用表示大家一起。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一起","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"共同做某事；다 같이 指大家一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c042902f18f92730c5c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67477-2-11-2","ko":"좋아요. 끝난 뒤에 모두 공연장 앞에서 모여요.","zh":"好啊。演出结束后，大家在演出场馆前面集合吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surf